# The item menu and the pause menu, from the battle-stuck quick save (out/bugsaves/battle-stuck, map 2
# sub-area 0, not committed; copy it first). Title (Start), the quick load at VI 100, R opens the item
# menu (player.c: R toggles core_flags bit 1), the cursor moves down twice, B closes it; Start opens the
# pause menu (status page), R turns to the map page, B twice closes it.
#   ELTALE_DATA_DIR=<copy> ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT=100 eltale-p1 --headless --fast --frames 650
#       --input tests/item-menu.input --rom ...
